    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Weapon Spell. For 20 seconds, target ally has a Splinter Weapon. Target ally's next 1...4...5 attack[s] deal 5...33...40 damage to up to 4 adjacent foes.",
      "zhTW": "持續 20 秒，目標友軍接下來 1～5 次攻擊，對最多 4 名相鄰敵人造成 5～40 傷害。"
    }
  },
